  "shopEmojisHelp": "Animated emojis for chat. Buy a set and send them in messages to friends.",
  "shopCollectionsHelp": "Collect a set of items: they appear in your profile showcase and can be gifted or sold. Each item pays coins every day, and a complete set also pays a separate bonus.\n\nAn item's daily income depends on its condition and is a share of the usual amount. New pays 100%. Worn pays 60%. Tired pays 40%. Shabby pays 100%. A vintage item pays 200%, twice the usual daily income.\n\nThe complete-set bonus stays the same until the set is vintage. A set is vintage when every item in it is vintage: the bonus is then 300%, three times the usual amount.\n\nCondition depends on how long you have owned the item. New — the first 7 days. Worn — from day 8 until 2 months. Tired — from 2 to 6 months. Shabby — from 6 months until 1 year. Vintage — after 1 year.\n\nYou can sell only a new or vintage item: sell for 80% of the price when new, and sell for 300% of the price when vintage. Worn, tired and shabby items cannot be sold.",
